sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant D as DashboardPage
    participant OV as Overview API
    participant POV as PortfolioOverviewService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: === 概览数据聚合 (Overview) ===
    D->>OV: GET /api/portfolios/:id/overview
    OV->>POV: getOverview(portfolioId)
    par 并行查询
        POV->>DB: SELECT totalAsset, date FROM asset_snapshots ORDER BY date DESC LIMIT 1
        POV->>DB: SELECT * FROM daily_nav ORDER BY date DESC LIMIT 1
        POV->>DB: SELECT * FROM daily_xirr ORDER BY date DESC LIMIT 1
        POV->>DB: SELECT SUM(amount) FROM transactions GROUP BY type
    end
    DB-->>POV: 当前总资产 + 最新净值 + 最新XIRR + 净投入
    POV->>POV: totalReturnRate = cumulativeNav - 1<br/>yearReturnRate = yearNav - 1
    POV-->>OV: { totalAsset, cumulativeNav, yearNav, xirr, netInvested, totalReturnRate, yearReturnRate, latestDate }
    OV-->>D: 概览数据
    D->>D: 渲染 6 张 StatCard

    ---
    Note over U,DB: === 持仓录入 + 一键同步 ===
    U->>D: 录入/更新持仓（标的+数量+成本+现价）
    D->>D: PUT /api/portfolios/:id/holdings
    Note right of D: ⚠️ 持仓保存不触发 NAV/XIRR (C-09)
    D->>D: 刷新持仓表格 + 汇总条
    U->>D: 点击「一键同步」
    D->>D: POST /api/portfolios/:id/holdings/sync-snapshot
    Note over D,DB: 持仓合计写入 AssetSnapshot
    Note over D,DB: snapshot.upsert 触发 recalculateFromDate
    Note over D,DB: 逐日重算净值 + XIRR (按日期升序)
    D->>D: Toast: "已同步 ¥X 至资产快照，并重算 N 天"

    ---
    Note over U,DB: === 交易录入 + 级联重算 ===
    U->>D: 填写交易（标的+数量+单价+费用）
    D->>D: zod 校验 + 自动推算 amount
    D->>D: POST /api/portfolios/:id/transactions
    Note over D,DB: INSERT Transaction (含扩展字段)
    Note over D,DB: recalculateFromDate(portfolioId, date)
    Note over D,DB: 逐日重算净值 + XIRR
    D->>D: Toast: "已保存，重算 2025-03-15 起 138 天"

    ---
    Note over U,DB: === 净值查询（四维度） ===
    U->>D: 选择维度「按月」+ 范围「近 1 年」
    D->>D: GET /api/portfolios/:id/nav<br/>?granularity=month&aggregation=last
    Note over D,DB: SELECT daily_nav WHERE date BETWEEN
    Note over D,DB: 按月聚合（取每月最后交易日值）
    D->>D: NavTrendChart 渲染双线图

    ---
    Note over U,DB: === 数据导入 ===
    U->>D: 上传 CSV 文件
    D->>D: POST /api/portfolios/:id/import (multipart)
    Note over D,DB: 逐行校验（行号+字段+原因）
    Note over D,DB: 预览前 10 行
    U->>D: 确认导入
    Note over D,DB: 批量 INSERT
    Note over D,DB: recalculateAll() 全量重算
    D->>D: Toast: "已导入 N 条，重算 M 天"
